WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.087 --> 00:00:02.171
- Kids, don't try this at home.

00:00:03.047 --> 00:00:04.551
(heroic music)

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:11.557
- Let's go.

00:00:11.557 --> 00:00:12.602
(squeals)

00:00:12.602 --> 00:00:14.019
(balloon squeaking)

00:00:14.019 --> 00:00:15.482
- You don't get in the Superbowl

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:17.235
by not being in 10th.

00:00:17.235 --> 00:00:19.069
- I'm gonna take a note from Isaac

00:00:19.069 --> 00:00:20.729
and start building while I drink.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:22.691
- What are you doing?

00:00:22.691 --> 00:00:24.235
- Making mistakes, man.

00:00:24.235 --> 00:00:26.070
- They asked Picasso what he was doing.

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:27.439
- Get outta my balloon idea!

00:00:27.439 --> 00:00:29.112
- You're just building a wizard's staff

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:30.482
with a balloon that's losing air.

00:00:30.482 --> 00:00:31.410
(balloon pops)

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:32.751
(screams and laughter)

00:00:33.662 --> 00:00:34.870
- You guys get outta here.

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.251
- That's so good!

00:00:36.251 --> 00:00:38.086
I mean it sucks mine's way better.

00:00:38.086 --> 00:00:39.258
(laughter)

00:00:39.258 --> 00:00:40.628
I'm double tasking.

00:00:40.628 --> 00:00:41.929
- You're double tasking?

00:00:41.929 --> 00:00:43.008
Is that what it's called?

00:00:43.008 --> 00:00:44.634
Double tasking?

00:00:45.944 --> 00:00:46.542
(balloon pops)

00:00:46.542 --> 00:00:48.042
- Oh, yes!

00:00:48.042 --> 00:00:49.436
(cheering)

00:00:50.536 --> 00:00:52.438
That baby is what we call payback!

00:00:53.105 --> 00:00:54.428
- How much time do we have left?

00:00:54.428 --> 00:00:56.019
- You guys are a mess and
I'm fucking cleaning up.

00:00:56.019 --> 00:00:57.273
- 90 seconds?

00:00:57.273 --> 00:00:58.097
Give me another balloon!

00:00:58.097 --> 00:00:59.857
- Nooooooooo!

00:01:00.895 --> 00:01:01.940
- Oh my God I can't believe

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:03.066
I pulled it out in the end.

00:01:03.066 --> 00:01:04.448
(grumbling)

00:01:04.448 --> 00:01:05.737
How's that cowboy?

00:01:05.737 --> 00:01:07.234
Like my burps?

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:09.521
- Oh man, I can smell your burps.

00:01:09.521 --> 00:01:10.288
- What's wrong?

00:01:10.288 --> 00:01:12.076
- I had the best thing going.

00:01:12.076 --> 00:01:13.283
- You really did.

00:01:13.283 --> 00:01:14.443
- I'm a Goddamned fiend.

00:01:14.443 --> 00:01:15.872
- Ok you know what this looks like

00:01:15.872 --> 00:01:18.456
a fucking mountain.

00:01:19.251 --> 00:01:20.737
(people counting down from 10)

00:01:20.737 --> 00:01:22.177
Noo boooo!

00:01:23.092 --> 00:01:24.961
Sorry I booed you, it's not your fault.

00:01:24.961 --> 00:01:25.792
- Yes!

00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:26.392
(screaming)

00:01:26.392 --> 00:01:27.583
- Oh baby!

00:01:30.307 --> 00:01:31.759
- I had the most amazing trophy,

00:01:31.759 --> 00:01:34.684
of all time I'm pretty sure.

00:01:34.684 --> 00:01:36.263
Except it popped

00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:37.691
because I got too aggressive

00:01:37.691 --> 00:01:40.315
and tried to put hair on it.

00:01:40.315 --> 00:01:41.778
I don't know, I'm okay with finishing

00:01:41.778 --> 00:01:43.822
four in the 15 minutes.

00:01:43.822 --> 00:01:45.366
Proud of it.

00:01:45.366 --> 00:01:48.692
My parents won't be proud, but I'm proud.

00:01:49.371 --> 00:01:51.531
I made this nice cowboy

00:01:51.531 --> 00:01:52.738
and I was gonna make him

00:01:52.738 --> 00:01:54.410
a nice mountain to stand on.

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:56.116
I only finished two and a half beers

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:58.003
and I'm like this, so that's...

00:01:59.298 --> 00:02:00.296
- I was really stoked,

00:02:00.296 --> 00:02:02.711
these guys went straight for the beer,

00:02:02.711 --> 00:02:03.791
I had a strategy, I was gonna

00:02:03.791 --> 00:02:05.335
blow my balloon up first.

00:02:05.335 --> 00:02:07.924
The first one kind of ran away from me

00:02:07.924 --> 00:02:09.723
the second one popped.

00:02:09.723 --> 00:02:11.465
I was really proud of this one,

00:02:11.465 --> 00:02:14.350
this third one was gonna be nice.

00:02:15.261 --> 00:02:16.596
It was gonna be the good one.

00:02:16.596 --> 00:02:17.436
- What does it say?

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:17.978
- Nice.

00:02:19.148 --> 00:02:21.526
- And I like that my failures
are just jokes to you,

00:02:21.526 --> 00:02:23.355
you bastards.

00:02:23.511 --> 00:02:25.067
- I feel like I wanna budge your trophies.

00:02:26.577 --> 00:02:28.984
Here they're all around me.

